# Names the guide shows in bold that tools/lint-guide.py does not find in
# faraday/faraday-strings/src/en.rs: test values, glyphs, words of the public
# test keys, and text the app makes outside en.rs. One name per line, then
# "  # reason". A line "re:<pattern>" matches a whole name.
×  # the remove glyph on a chip
⋮  # the menu glyph
?  # the Learn glyph on the top bar
-  # the stepper's minus
+  # the stepper's plus
12  # a word count, a button and a value
24  # a word count, a button and a value
C  # share index of the published codex32 sample set
D  # share index of the published codex32 sample set
zebra  # word of a public test key
summer  # word of a public test key
torch  # word 12 of the published test seed
off  # the status value in "Secure Boot: on" or "off"
2/s  # a speed button of the QR display
5/s  # a speed button of the QR display
new-wallet-1-descriptor  # file name the wallet's descriptor is saved under
Final  # the codex32 checksum worksheet's row label, drawn by the worksheet
Must read  # the codex32 checksum worksheet's row label, drawn by the worksheet
Demo only  # the Demo's sample card title, drawn by the Demo shell
re:fee rate is about [0-9]+ sat/vB  # Review's warning, made in faraday-psbt
